{
  "cdmVersionRange": ">=5.0.0",
  "_README": [
    "Peripheral artery disease of the lower extremity, as the Kraiss sVQI-FS pvd item.",
    "",
    "SAME concept set as the target cohort's PAD indication (cohort 9100011, \"[DVI] Lower Extremity Peripheral",
    "Artery Occlusive Disease\"): arteriosclerosis of artery of extremity, peripheral vascular disease associated",
    "with another disorder, peripheral ischemia and peripheral arterial disease, with descendants, less ten",
    "non-lower-extremity roots (upper-limb, embolic, renal, intestinal, thoracic, aortic arch branch).",
    "Changed 2026-11-05 from OMOP 317309 + descendants so that Table 1 PAD and this item are one phenotype.",
    "Kraiss 2022 defines the item by ABI < 0.7 or prior arterial intervention/amputation; those relate only to",
    "lower-extremity arterial disease, so a diagnosis-based lower-extremity PAD set is the proxy.",
    "",
    "DELIBERATELY NOT the [DVI] VA-FI Peripheral vascular disease cohort (1797955), a faithful VA-FI deficit that",
    "also spans aortic aneurysm and venous thrombosis (not peripheral ARTERIAL disease).",
    "PrimaryCriteriaLimit / QualifiedLimit / ExpressionLimit are all \"All\" and EndStrategy is StartDate+0, unlike the",
    "[DVI] VA-FI cohorts (1797948-1797977) which are \"First\". A first-ever-only cohort cannot answer a lookback-window question."
  ],
